  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to conjure a swarm of gnawing scarabs in a Far range in front of the <span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Pharaoh</span>. All targets in that area must make an Agility Reaction Roll. Targets who fail take <strong>4d6+6</strong> physical damage and must mark an Armor Slot without receiving its benefits (they can still use armor to reduce the damage). If they can’t mark an Armor Slot, they must mark an additional HP. Targets who succeed take half damage.</p>",
